  "description": "MAIN FEATURES\n- Tough and light alloy frame based on Decade\n- Manitou Circus Expert, 110x20mm boost axle\n- NS Bikes aftermarket cockpit\n- Hydraulic rear brake\n- NS Bikes Sealed bearing FRONT hub, 10t driver rear hub\n- Strong RaceFace Aeffect crankset\nThe Movement’s heart is the lightweight alloy frame with oversized tubes. It’s designed to let you send, higher and faster than ever. The dialed geometry that has evolved over the years is identical to the legendary Decade frames. The bike is fitted with an fan favourite Manitou Circus Expert fork with tapered steer tube and rugged 110x20mm thru-axle that is tough and rigid. RaceFace Aeffect crankset, and a micro drivetrain complement the character of the Movement 2. The hydraulic disc brake on the back will give you all the stopping power you’ll ever need.",
